/-!
# Prime-degree torus packets

Equidistribution of complete volume-weighted packets of arbitrary full
lattices in totally real fields of fixed prime degree at least five.
The packet discriminant is that of its multiplier order. The arithmetic
and positive-entropy rigidity inputs are discharged, giving tightness and
weak convergence to Haar probability.
-/
